### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8085
@dockerUrl = http://notification-service:8085
@contentType = application/json

### ─── READ ALL NOTIFICATIONS ───
### Returns 5 seeded notifications (EMAIL, SMS, PUSH)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── READ NOTIFICATION BY ID ───
### Notification 1: Welcome email to john_doe
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── READ NOTIFICATION BY ID ───
### Notification 3: SMS payment confirmation to jane_smith
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/3
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── READ NOTIFICATION BY ID (non-existent) ───
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/999
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── SEND EMAIL NOTIFICATION ───
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "type": "EMAIL",
  "message": "Your order has been shipped and will arrive in 2 business days."
}

### ─── SEND SMS NOTIFICATION ───
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 2,
  "type": "SMS",
  "message": "Your verification code is 48291."
}

### ─── SEND PUSH NOTIFICATION ───
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 3,
  "type": "PUSH",
  "message": "Your item is back in stock!"
}

### ─── SEND NOTIFICATION (invalid type) ───
### Should fail with bad request due to enum constraint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "type": "SMOKE_SIGNAL",
  "message": "This should fail."
}

### ─── MCP TOOL DISCOVERY (SSE) ───
GET {{baseUrl}}/mcp/sse
Accept: text/event-stream

### ─── HEALTH CHECK ───
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: {{contentType}}